    "message": "Map actual positive polynomial zeros to a marked cyclic Wang word\n\nChoose the actual selected tile at every canonical inverse cell coordinate and retain its complete Selected binding in the original Boolean word. Prove actual origin Start and both color matches from original Facts alone, transporting exact full-word source bases rather than choosing a fresh word or stride.\n\nPreserve the original unreduced rank quotient, prove its stride nonzero modulo the cell cycle and positive naturally, and augment the original N/source/carry/digit witnesses in the polynomial endpoint. Add independent full-source review, fresh bounded Lean main/check replay and nine standard-only axiom reports. Update README and the live proof plan while explicitly retaining machine-run extraction, converse/controller, remaining frontiers and internal-ZFC obligations.",
